{"id":"schlau","lemma":"schlau","pos":"adj","rank":1441,"glosses":["clever in a way that enables one to achieve one's goals; slightly sly or cunning (but not usually implying any evil intentions)","bright, intelligent, clever (with no such overtone at all)"],"ipa":"/ʃlaʊ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/De-schlau.ogg/De-schlau.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"schlauer","superlative":"am schlauesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Mein Hund ist ziemlich schlau.","en":"My dog is pretty smart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759441","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"pretty"},null]},{"text":"Er ist ein schlauer Junge.","en":"He is a clever boy.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"boy"}]},{"text":"Das wäre schlau.","en":"That would be smart.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Wieso bist du so schlau?","en":"Why are you so smart?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Du bist ein Schlauer.","en":"You're a sly one.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}